  ('6a3445f4-eebe-4eac-bb8b-117371135f18', '67d56190-5f8b-4b38-bd62-cc422ad87887', 'TG_MOV_MOCK2_013', 'Who was NOT a member of the 4-member Cabinet Sub-Committee on Mulki Rules appointed by Chief Minister Burgula on 7 September 1952?', 'K.V. Ranga Reddy', 'Dr. G.S. Melkote', 'Phoolchand Gandhi', 'V.B. Raju', 'The 4 members of the Cabinet Sub-Committee were:  
