  ('ae325930-dcb4-4f92-b145-ac8327c49e33', '67d56190-5f8b-4b38-bd62-cc422ad87887', 'TG_MOV_MOCK2_014', 'According to the findings of the 1952 Cabinet Sub-Committee, approximately how many fake/bogus Mulki certificates were detected in government service?', 'Nearly 2,000', 'Nearly 5,000', 'Over 40,000', 'Over 1,00,000', 'The committee found widespread forgery where more than 40,000 non-Mulkis from neighbouring Andhra/Madras and Bombay states had secured government appointments using fraudulent residence affidavits.', '14 [Bogus Certificates / నకిలీ సర్టిఫికెట్లు]
