  ('c573845d-1168-436d-bcc0-7b2f9d3a2253', '67d56190-5f8b-4b38-bd62-cc422ad87887', 'TG_MOV_MOCK2_047', 'In November 1952, following the Cabinet Sub-Committee recommendations, the Hyderabad Government issued orders stating that non-Mulkis holding which category of jobs would be replaced by Mulkis?', 'All Gazetted All-India Officers', 'Subordinate and Non-Gazetted Services', 'High Court Judges', 'University Professors only', 'The government resolved to repatriate non-Mulkis occupying non-gazetted and subordinate posts (teachers, clerks, patwaris) and enforce strict 15-year domicile verification for fresh recruitment.', '47 [Government Notification / ప్రభుత్వ చర్యలు]
