  ('28ca1cd9-e495-49a7-a827-37eba1c7cfc8', '67d56190-5f8b-4b38-bd62-cc422ad87887', 'TG_MOV_MOCK8_002', '**Match the members of the 1948 Pandit Sunderlal Goodwill Mission with their respective identities/professions:**
